@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Student" as student
actor "Administrator" as admin

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {

    usecase "View Room Availability (US-01)" as UC1
    usecase "Book Room (US-02, US-03, US-05)" as UC2
    usecase "Cancel Own Booking (US-04)" as UC3
    usecase "Block / Unblock Room (US-07)" as UC5
    usecase "Review Room Usage (US-08)" as UC6

    student --> UC1
    student --> UC2
    student --> UC3

    admin --> UC5
    admin --> UC6

    note right of UC2
      R1: Start must be in the future.
      Duration must be > 0 and <= 2 hours.

      R2: Active bookings for the same
      room cannot overlap.

      R3: A blocked room cannot accept
      a new booking.

      R4: A successful booking produces
      a confirmation.
    end note
}

' Assumption A1:
' A booking that starts exactly when another booking ends
' is not considered an overlap.

' Assumption A2:
' Blocking a room prevents new bookings only.
' Existing bookings remain unchanged.

@enduml